  "strengths": [
    "Branch, diff and merge tables with cell-level conflict detection",
    "Query any past commit with AS OF for full audit history",
    "Drop-in MySQL client compatibility for tools and ORMs",
    "Push/pull/clone databases between remotes like Git",
    "Pull-request style data review on DoltHub"
